es. A Fresh Lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043813","verified_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1847286114038728","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Over 7,000 Wishlists! & Demo Update","summary":"Thanks to your support, Life Is a Dungeon: Lean into It. has passed 7,000 wishlists! A huge thank-you to everyone who has wishlisted the game or played the demo! Your reviews, Community Hub posts, and recommendations mean so much to us. We'll keep working to make the game even more enjoyable! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}46280661/f7da03c7c999a433202dde9e8ef9026aac19d016.gif Demo Update This update focuses on adding shading that responds to light and reducing the rendering workload. We've also improved equi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:43:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038728","verified_at":"2026-10-24T08:34:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1847286114028174","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"6,000 Wishlists! & Demo Update v0.1146.0.37","summary":"Over 6,000 Wishlists! Thanks to your support, we have surpassed 6,000 wishlists! A huge thank you to everyone who has wishlisted the game and played the demo! Your reviews, Community Hub posts, and recommendations are a great source of encouragement. We will keep working to make the game even more enjoyable! Demo Update We have updated the game based on your feedback and impressions. This update adds a loot filter to make collecting equipment easier, along with new unique gear. We have also adde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:28:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028174","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:39:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1846651706680320","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Over 5,000 Wishlists! / Demo Update v0.1109.0.36","summary":"🎉Over 5,000 Wishlists!🎉 Thank you for playing the demo and adding the game to your wishlist! Thanks to your support, we have now passed 5,000 wishlists! If you haven’t played yet, please give the demo a try. If you’ve already enjoyed it, we’d be delighted if you shared it with your friends or on social media. We’ve updated the game based on your feedback and impressions. Update DetailsPotion Brewing Requests Added You can now ask feline familiars at the Hermit’s Hut to brew potions for you. Brew","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:52:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680320","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1846651706672976","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix Notice v0.1093.1.35","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo. Based on your reports, we have taken steps to address the following issue: An error occurring when opening the save slot list on some systems. If you have encountered this issue, please update the game and try again. We apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for helping us by reporting the issue. Thank you for your continued support of Life Is a Dungeon: Lean into It.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:40:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672976","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1846018067943516","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1093.0.35","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo! Your reviews and feedback on the Community Hub are a tremendous help as we work to make the game better. We truly appreciate your continued support! This update adds Japanese and English character voices, along with unique equipment featuring special effects. We have also improved combat feedback, manual controls, and hub usability, reduced processing load, and fixed bugs. Update Details Japanese and English Character Voices Added Japanese and English voic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:47:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1846018067932262","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Support Helped Us Reach 4,000 Wishlists!","summary":"🎉 4,000 Wishlists! 🎉Thank you for playing the demo and adding the game to your wishlist! We’ve reached 4,000 wishlists!If you haven’t played yet, please give the demo a try. If you’ve already played, we’d be delighted if you introduced the game to your friends and others.Your reviews and feedback encourage us as we continue working on updates every day. Please share your thoughts and experiences through reviews and the Community Hub!Thank you for your continued support of Life Is a Dungeon: Lean","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T06:14:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932262","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1846018067925762","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1053.0.34","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo! Your feedback and impressions shared in reviews and on the Community Hub are a huge help in making the game better. Thank you, as always!This update revisits how different weapons feel and how attacks connect, and improves equipment rewards from enemies. We have also made dungeon progress easier to follow and equipment easier to find and organize in storage.Update Details Distinct attack speeds and reach for each weapon type Weapon types now have different","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:02:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1845383656392983","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1040.0.33","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo! We have released an update based on your feedback and impressions. This update adds more ways to enjoy collecting and upgrading equipment, including the Traveling Merchant’s Bargains, new Treasure Goblins, and Implicit Orbs. We have also improved exploration and equipment management, and added more combat visuals and sound effects. Update Details Equipment Bargains at the Traveling Merchant You can now buy equipment with a variety of additional effects fro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T09:34:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1845383656384849","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Mini Update v0.1027.1.32","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo! Based on your feedback and impressions, we have made the following adjustments and fixes. Update Details Changed how bonus effects are rolled when using Orbs and adjusted their probabilities. Fixed an issue where the controller D-pad did not work in certain situations. We will continue updating the game based on your feedback. Thank you for your continued support of Life Is a Dungeon: Lean into It.!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T03:58:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1845383656380488","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Mini Update v0.1026.0.31","summary":"Demo Mini Update Thank you for playing the demo! Based on your feedback and impressions, we’ve made the following improvements and adjustments. Improved controller controls Adjusted game balance from the second floor onward We’ll continue updating the game based on your feedback. Thank you for your continued support of Life Is a Dungeon: Lean into It.!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T09:23:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1844751498230760","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1013.0.30","summary":"Thank you for spending so much time with the demo! We have updated the game based on your feedback and impressions. Alongside controller support, this update adds ways to protect your treasured equipment and makes switching and collecting gear more convenient. Update Details Controller supportYou can now play with a controller, from exploration and combat to navigating menus and using facilities. Lock your treasured equipmentYou can now lock equipment to prevent accidentally selling, dismantling","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T07:27:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230760","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1844751498220441","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.986.0.29","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo! We have released an update based on your feedback and impressions. This update introduces mouse-and-keyboard controls, default menu pausing in Casual mode, and improvements to how Orbs replace equipment bonus effects. We have also refined combat controls, automatic movement, and Magic Core Compression. Update Details Mouse-and-keyboard controls Added Classic controls, which combine the mouse and keyboard. You can control your character directly, moving wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T06:51:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220441","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1844115010498696","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.972.1.28","summary":"Thank you for spending so much time with the demo! We've put together an update based on your feedback and impressions. This update brings stronger skills and spells, adjustments to dungeon difficulty, and other changes to help you progress through your adventures. You can also carry more types of items, find your way to bosses and portals more easily, and see your stats more clearly. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46280661/c3769ef38c88de93b07d58babe5920c1d76363ba.gif What's in This Update Buffs to Selected","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T10:40:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498696","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1843481262704031","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.963.3.26","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo! We've released an update based on your feedback and impressions.This update expands the in-game explanations to help you better understand what attributes do and how skills work. We've added explanations to Game Tips and revised both skill acquisition descriptions and the details shown for skill icons.Update DetailsMore explanations and navigation in Game TipsAdded Basic Attributes explanations to Game Tips at the Training Statue. You can check the roles of Vitali","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T09:16:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1843481262701335","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Support Helped Us Reach 3,000 Wishlists!","summary":"3,000 wishlists! Thank you to everyone who played the demo or added the game to their wishlist. For a game that started out unknown, reaching this many people without advertising is all thanks to you. Your feedback on the demo helps us improve the game. Wishlisting, sharing your thoughts, and recommending the game to friends help more people discover it. We want more people to get to play this game, and we’re counting on your continued support! We’ll keep working on updates to make the game even","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T10:40:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701335","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1843481262700974","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.962.0.25","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo! We’ve released an update based on your feedback and impressions. This update focuses on magic skills, which received a lot of feedback, along with game balance adjustments. We’ve also added video tutorials and in-game guidance to help make the controls and skills easier to understand. Update Details Magic Skill Controls and MP Recovery Magic Missile is now activated by right-clicking an enemy. It can be used both while exploring and during combat. Teleport","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T07:57:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062910-1843481262694356","game_id":"steam-5062910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.943.0.24","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo! We've released an update based on your feedback and impressions. This update brings balance adjustments to help you get more out of upgrading equipment with orbs and experimenting with ability combinations. Update Details Orb Availability, Drop Rates, and Rewards Blue Orbs are now easier to obtain early in the game, and Purple Orbs are easier to obtain from the midgame onward. Increased the number of orbs awarded for boss battles. Orb rewards from dungeon events a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T07:55:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/stea